{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_title", "source_sha256": "75744d2e73ac763eae68786659dabd6bd16d3e5cd7e08fc473c104013d58571e", "ja": "ouverture：ラスト・アクトレス", "zh": "ouverture：最后女演员", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1d6224b83636bf169d55c4dfab5c8c8812d1a43b9568e5aba9f036b12ee8db1d", "ja": "『屋根裏の道化師』それは実際の殺人事件を\nモチーフとした物語。突如巻き起こる殺人の\n数々……。果たして、事件の真相は……？", "zh": "《阁楼里的小丑》是以真实杀人事件\n为原型的故事。突然发生的多起杀人事件……\n事件的真相究竟是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_1000_017kth", "source_sha256": "4a9dcff9cf20d0468b39a8dfd51c3fd5a70392bfc66830e97e6d5f55bec961de", "ja": "追跡の手を逃れた道化師は、そのまま劇場に棲みつきま\nした。そして今でも屋根裏から、私達を監視しているの", "zh": "逃脱追捕的小丑，就这样潜伏在剧场里安了家。而且直到现在，也依然在阁楼上监视着我们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7463cdf3982e04bea048b1253961273d6d98e9abcfafaa59e5a5d3aeb629747f", "ja": "なるほど、\nこの部屋は密室だったということになりますね。", "zh": "原来如此，\n这么说来，这个房间当时成了密室呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c34bc3351c347313d2814148e4513c1b52efa08ebc7b98e32e2d679662e96432", "ja": "僕の名前、はウォーカー。……職業は、探偵です。", "zh": "我的名字，是沃克。……职业是名侦探。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "8e4f3b482910fd935b3eddeca45227f10679de71a6a519325416891d2deb1ebd", "ja": "『屋根裏の道化師』は、必ず上演します。", "zh": "《阁楼的小丑》，一定会如期上演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "f855214e993d0ce4a23ca7de834361cbcef10e60eae940a7fdb402e9ab7943cb", "ja": "普通じゃないわ！\nこの劇団に、まともな人はいないの!?", "zh": "太不正常了！\n这个剧团里，就没有正常人了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_017_6thlm_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thlm_12_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ec743b398330512c864edc3170b1ad715669b2370844777752dbddf84be34a3", "ja": "道化師の伝説は、本当だったんですね……。", "zh": "小丑的传说是真的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
